<style is:global>
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Lora';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url('/fonts/lora-600.woff2') format('woff2');
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Lora';
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url('/fonts/lora-italic-500.woff2') format('woff2');
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Public Sans';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url('/fonts/public-sans-400.woff2') format('woff2');
  }

  :root {
    --paper: #F1ECDD;
    --paper-alt: #E7E0C9;
    --ink: #20261B;
    --ink-soft: #4B5240;
    --moss: #5E6E37;
    --ochre: #A9793C;
    --line: #C7BFA4;
    --font-display: 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
    --font-body: 'Public Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
      --paper: #14170F;
      --paper-alt: #1B1F14;
      --ink: #ECE6D2;
      --ink-soft: #B9B49E;
      --moss: #9CB36B;
      --ochre: #C79A5C;
      --line: #3A3A2C;
    }
  }

  :root[data-theme="dark"] {
    --paper: #14170F;
    --paper-alt: #1B1F14;
    --ink: #ECE6D2;
    --ink-soft: #B9B49E;
    --moss: #9CB36B;
    --ochre: #C79A5C;
    --line: #3A3A2C;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  html, body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  html {
    color-scheme: light dark;
    -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
    text-size-adjust: 100%;
  }

  a:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--moss);
    outline-offset: 3px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  ::selection {
    background: var(--moss);
    color: var(--paper);
  }

  body {
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 6vh 6vw;
    line-height: 1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  .wrap {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  .hero {
    position: relative;
    padding: 4rem 0 3rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .parcels {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -10% -6% auto -6%;
    height: 130%;
    width: 112%;
    z-index: 0;
    opacity: 0.55;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .parcels path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--line);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .parcels path.accent {
    stroke: var(--ochre);
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 4rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 3vw, 1.35rem);
    color: var(--moss);
    margin: 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin: 2.5rem auto 0;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .intro p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .intro p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .intro a {
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration-color: var(--ochre);
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }

  .intro a:hover {
    color: var(--moss);
    text-decoration-color: var(--moss);
  }

  .invite {
    margin: 3.5rem 0 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .register {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .register-row {
    display: flex;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .plot {
    flex: 1 1 50%;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem;
  }

  .plot + .plot {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .plot-name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .plot-links {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .plot-mail {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .plot-mail:hover {
    color: var(--moss);
    border-bottom-color: var(--moss);
  }

  .visually-hidden {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    margin: -1px;
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip-path: inset(50%);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }

  footer {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 30rem) {
    .register-row {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .plot + .plot {
      border-left: none;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
  }

  @media print {
    body {
      display: block;
      min-height: 0;
      background: #fff;
      color: #000;
    }
    .parcels { display: none; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .hero-content {
      animation: rise 0.7s ease-out;
    }
  }

  @keyframes rise {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <main>
    <div class="hero">
      <svg class="parcels" viewBox="0 0 800 500" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M0,120 L210,95 L260,240 L40,290 Z" />
        <path d="M210,95 L470,60 L520,210 L260,240 Z" class="accent" />
        <path d="M470,60 L800,40 L800,190 L520,210 Z" />
        <path d="M40,290 L260,240 L300,420 L60,460 Z" />
        <path d="M260,240 L520,210 L560,400 L300,420 Z" class="accent" />
        <path d="M520,210 L800,190 L800,380 L560,400 Z" />
      </svg>
      <div class="hero-content">
        <p class="eyebrow">Sociale softwarestudio</p>
        <h1>Gemeengoed</h1>
        <p class="tagline">Software die een sector samen bouwt en samen bezit.</p>
        <div class="intro">
          <p>In cultuur, welzijn en kinderopvang betaalt elke organisatie apart voor hetzelfde wiel. De groten laten dure software op maat maken. De rest behelpt zich met pakketten die voor iemand anders gemaakt zijn, of haalt acrobatentoeren uit met Excel.</p>
          <p>Wij brengen organisaties met hetzelfde probleem samen rond één softwarebasis. Ze bouwen mee, beslissen mee in een gebruikersraad en betalen naar draagkracht. Wat we maken, blijven we onderhouden.</p>
          <p>Zo bracht Anton eerder 200 lokale besturen samen rond <a href="https://opvang.vlaanderen">Opvang.Vlaanderen</a>. Nu bouwen we aan een eerste dienst, voor vrijwilligerscoördinatoren.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="invite">Werkt de software in jouw sector tegen? Mail een van ons.</p>

    <div class="register" role="group" aria-label="Contact">
      <div class="register-row">
        <div class="plot">
          <h2 class="plot-name">Frederik Vincx</h2>
          <ul class="plot-links">
            <li><a class="plot-mail" href="mailto:frederik@gemeengoed.studio">frederik@gemeengoed.studio</a></li>
            <li><a class="plot-mail" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/frederikvincx/" rel="noopener">LinkedIn<span class="visually-hidden"> van Frederik Vincx</span></a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="plot">
          <h2 class="plot-name">Anton Aerts</h2>
          <ul class="plot-links">
            <li><a class="plot-mail" href="mailto:anton@gemeengoed.studio">anton@gemeengoed.studio</a></li>
            <li><a class="plot-mail" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/antonaerts/" rel="noopener">LinkedIn<span class="visually-hidden"> van Anton Aerts</span></a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    </main>

    <footer>&copy; 2026 Gemeengoed</footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
